{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Matrix Addition.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Matrix Addition.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"matrix addition matrix addition","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Matrix Addition.md","fileName":"Matrix Addition.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Matrix Addition","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-06 19:44\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Matrix and Vector Computation]] · [[FEM Mathematical Foundations]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Matrix and Vector Computation","FEM Mathematical Foundations","Zero Matrix","Scalar Multiplication of a Matrix","appliedlinearalgebraandoptimizationusingmatlab.pdf","finiteelementanalysis_aprimer.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Matrix Addition.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Matrix Addition.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"matrix addition matrix addition","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Matrix Addition.md","fileName":"Matrix Addition.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Matrix Addition","heading":"Matrix Addition","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Matrix addition combines two matrices of the same size by adding corresponding entries. If $A=(a_{ij})$ and $B=(b_{ij})$, then $A+B=(a_{ij}+b_{ij})$. The result has the same dimensions as both inputs.\n\nThe operation is commutative and associative, and the [[Zero Matrix]] acts as its additive identity. Matrix subtraction is addition of a [[Scalar Multiplication of a Matrix|scalar multiple]] by $-1$.\n\nDuring finite element assembly, matrices from elements sharing a degree of freedom contribute by addition to the corresponding global entries. Compatible dimensions and consistent local-to-global numbering are therefore essential.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Matrix and Vector Computation","FEM Mathematical Foundations","Zero Matrix","Scalar Multiplication of a Matrix","appliedlinearalgebraandoptimizationusingmatlab.pdf","finiteelementanalysis_aprimer.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Matrix Addition.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Matrix Addition.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"matrix addition matrix addition","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Matrix Addition.md","fileName":"Matrix Addition.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Matrix Addition","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[appliedlinearalgebraandoptimizationusingmatlab.pdf]]\n\n[[finiteelementanalysis_aprimer.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Matrix and Vector Computation","FEM Mathematical Foundations","Zero Matrix","Scalar Multiplication of a Matrix","appliedlinearalgebraandoptimizationusingmatlab.pdf","finiteelementanalysis_aprimer.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}